1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married a third cousin: Cecilia was the great-granddaughter of Olof Olofsson, while her husband was the great-grandson of Anders Olofsson, brother of Olof Olofsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Bure's släktbok, copy X37: "Wife: Cecil Hans Andersons at Bure." In the account of the children, it is stated directly next to the son Anders the following notice: "several small brothers died." Johan Bure's släktbok, copy X
2 CONC 37, op. 85-86.
2 CONT
