1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Geni and WikiTree (quoting Lundström): "Homestead was taken over by Tomas Kettilsson who was probably from Degerbyn and nephew of Per Tomasson. He was married to Kälug Andersdotter, a daughter of Anders Jakobs
2 CONC son and Malin Andersdotter. According to Johan Bure, the couple had children: Malin, Jon, (our ancestor) Margareta who was married to Per Jonsson in Kusmark, and Sara. At this time the home net is divided and [Kälug's brother-in-l
2 CONC aw and sister] Andreas Olai and Anna Andersdotter break out part of the homestead, which becomes Storkåge no. 1.
2 CONT "In 1553, there were 16 cows on the farm. In 1553 he had delivered ½ timber of ermine skins from Lapland to the crown. In 1554, Tomas Kettilsson had delivered 7 foxes, 1 otter and 4 timbers of deer skin to the crown. In 1560 he pa
2 CONC id Russian customs, so he must have traded with the Russians at Torne market.
2 CONT "In 1560, Tomas Kettilsson and Lasse Andersson were in Yttervik to Stockholm with a schooner. Tomas Kettilsson's cargo amounted to 2 loads. It contained 9 barrels of salmon, 2 barrels of seal blubber, 2 ship pounds and 6 lis pound
2 CONC s of pike, 1 ship pound and 2 lis pounds of perch, 100 spit salmon, 4 decks and 6 pieces (46) of cow hides, 25½ decks (251) of buckskins, 25 timbers of gray skins, 10 decks (100) calfskin.
2 CONT "In 1571, at the ransom of Älvsborg [tax to reclaim the captured fortress from the Danes], Tomas Kettilsson had 60 lods of silver, 60 marks in money, 1½ bowls of tin, 1 bowls of brass, 3 bowls of copper, 10 cows, 4 heifers of 2 ye
2 CONC ars, 8 sheep, 8 goats, 2 pigs and 1 horse, for 20 marks. The property was valued at 500 marks."
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a merchant (Köpman) between 1554-1566, Grand Juror (Nämndeman) 1554-1584, Sexman 1584, and resident of Storkåge 4 to his death (Geni).
2 CONT
2 CONT From Lundström: According to Johan Bure, the couple had the children Malin, who was married to
2 CONT Sven Jonsson at Sunnanå, Jon Tomasson who was a priest in Dannemora chapel, Per, Margareta [our ancestor] who was married to Per Jonsson in Kusmark, Sara who was married to Olof Jonsson in Kusmark, and Gölug who was married to And
2 CONC ers Persson in Böle. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken (1539-1650)," pp. 93-94.
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (2004), pp. 96-97, Storkåge 4 Granden.
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Kettilsson-13
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 512339 gives source "B152/89" for birth.
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" USB (2017), person ID  2985.
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (2004), pp. 96-97, Storkåge 4 Granden.
2 CONT --------------
