1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Daniel Danielis Cuprimontanus Svinhufvud =
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daniel Danielis Montanus Svinhufvud , † 1588-05-22. Pastor 1570 in Vika pastorate / U. Signed in Stockholm the priests' decision on the liturgy in 1577 and renews this in January 1582. Married 1st with Brita Nilsdotter , † 1583.
2 CONC  Daughter of the bailiff on Åland Nils Persson Married 2nd with Karin Månsdotter , lived 1594-03-17. Daughter of Mårten Larsson.
2 CONT * [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svinhufvud_i_V%C3%A4sterg%C3%B6tland_nr_199#TAB_3 '''Daniel Danielis Montanus Svinhufvud'''], † 1588-05-22. Kyrkoherde 1570 i Vika pastorat. 
2 CONT * '''Underskrev i Stockholm''' prästernas beslut om liturgien 1577 och förnyar detta i januari 1582.  '''Gift 1:o''' med '''Brita Nilsdotter''', † 1583. Dotter till fogden på Åland Nils Persson. '''Gift 2:o''' med '''Karin Månsdot
2 CONC ter''', levde 1594-03-17. Dotter till Mårten Larsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Brita Nilsdotter  in 1st marriage:=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Daniel Danielsson Svinhufvud,''' † between 1587 and 1594 without heirs.
2 CONT * '''Anna Danielsdotter Svinhufvud,''' born 1570-10-03, † 1609-11-00 in cot at Mårtenmässotiden. and buried in Leksand's church / W. Married in 1597 to the rector and pastor of Leksand, Master Elof Engelberti Terserus, who is one 
2 CONC of the ancestors of the Tersér or Terschère family .
2 CONT * '''Elisabet Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1571-11-04, † young.
2 CONT * '''Elisabet Danielsdotter Svinhufvud.''' Married to Lasse Pedersson in Grävningen, Sandviken / X.
2 CONT * '''Margareta Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1574-08-06. Married to the citizen of Gävle Jon Jonsson , lived 1629. Councilor in Gävle 1606-1616, bailiff in Västerbotten 1619-1621 and lived in Umeå.
2 CONT * '''Carin Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1576-09-30, † as a child.
2 CONT * '''Brita Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1579-04-23, † 1673 a few days before 7/2.
2 CONT * '''Catharina Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1581-10-10. Married to chamberlain Göran Hansson.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Karin Månsdotter in 2nd marriage:=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sara Danielsdotter Svinhufvud''' born 1585-02-24, † young.
2 CONT * '''Georgius Danielis Svinhufvud''' also Wikaeus born 1586-05-25 in Vika, † 1638 after 3/5 but before 9/10 as deposed parish priest in Malung. Enrolled in Rostock in December 1608 and in Wittenberg 1609-07-28 and Helmstedt 1616-0
2 CONC 1-02. There were marital problems, the court ordered him to divorce when his wife was accused of adultery, which he refused. Because of this, he stayed away from the congregation for 7 weeks, and then he was suspended during the p
2 CONC eriod February 1624 until Pentecost 1624-05-16. Married to NN . After the divorce, it is not investigated whether it gained legal force, she seems to have moved to Hedemora, but probably lives in Falun 1650-1653, as there is a wif
2 CONC e Anna who can not have been the wife of any other priest in the diocese.
2 CONT * '''Mårten Danielsson Svinhufvud''' born 1587-12-13, † before 1594-03-17.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svinhufvud_i_V%C3%A4sterg%C3%B6tland_nr_199#TAB_3 '''Pork head in Västergötland no 199, by Adelsvapen Skin''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Enl: Lars Wallgrens hemsida:
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Danielsson Montanus [Svinhufvud i Västergötland] Död 22 maj 1588 i Vika (W). [1] Kyrkoherde, bergsman. Adress Vika sn,Kopp. Levnadsbeskrivning
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var kyrkoherde i Vika från 1570, och var också en av de större brukarna på Kopparberget, men bedrev också jordbruk i mindre skala. Han ägde hemmanet Grävningen och jord i Gringsbo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bland annat i Älvsborgs lösen 1571 tecknar han sig "Daniel Montanus". Gifte och barn
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift. Karin Nilsdotter. Tavla 1 Död omkr 1585. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Danielsdotter [Svinhufvud i Västergötland]. Tavla 1 Född 3 okt 1570. [1] Död 1609. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Källor
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Ekström 2. Hülphers 3. Boëthius
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
