1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Enrolled at Uppsala University May 1627--he was probably the first resident of Hjoggböle to study at the university. Farmer between 1631 and 1656 in Hjoggböle 1, Skellefteå lfs (AC). Probably son of Ambrosius Ander
2 CONC sson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Not mentioned by Johan Bure, but Urban Sikeborg writes: "Olof is stated by Nils Jakobsson Burman (1705–1750) to have been another son of Ambrosius Andersson. Considering his peculiar patronymic and the name Burman, Carlsson believ
2 CONC es that it should be beyond all doubt that he belonged to the group of siblings. The fact that he is not included in the family book may be due to the fact that he was not yet born when Johan Bure stayed in Skellefteå. About this 
2 CONC Olof Ambrosiusson's family circumstances, see Carl Henrik Carlsson's article, p. 39. Carlsson (1989)
2 CONT
2 CONT Note from Kråken: "from Bureå no. 3, marries wife Sara. He owns the household (hemmanet)  1631-1654. . . .  The couple have children Olof, Erik Olofsson Burman - councilman (rådman) in Piteå city, Jon, and Benjamin." Appears on ma
2 CONC ntal. (tax rolls) 1632, 1642, 1645, & 1650.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note from http://buredna.sjolunds.se/fragestallningar/ "Olof Ambrosiusson's agnatic descendant has been shown to have a haplotype that matches other tested descendants of the Bure family, Olof Ambrosiusson must have been the son o
2 CONC f one of the family's agnatic descendants of Old Olof. The patronymic Ambrosiusson, which is very unusual in Sweden, shows that Ambrosius Andersson must have been his father."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT DNA-verified Bure descendant on the paternal line. See Bure family lines verified with DNA, "Släktlinjer inon Buresläkten som verifierats med hjälp av DNA" (2016), https://buredna.sjolunds.se/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/Burelinjer-
2 CONC 161221.png
2 CONT "Bure Släkten" (Bure Family), written by Marc Hernelind pp. 37-38, 250
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 175027 gives source "PSj" for birth.
2 CONT Sweden Wikipedia article on Bureätten (Bure family studies), includes family tree: https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bureätten
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ambrosiusson-1
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" USB (2017), person ID 38 (his father Ambrosius Andersson Burman).
2 CONT
