1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lived at Mjödvattnet 1.
2 CONT From Geni: Died in Thirty Years War in Prussia, Germany. Farmer and soldier (Bonden, soldaten) Nils Andersson at Tjärn, Mjödvattnet, Burträsk, died 1638. Jordebok (Land records), 1599-1634. Sick in Prussia (sjuk i Preussen), 1636.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Burträsk Byar och gårdar 1539-1800" (2007), p. 1 Mjödvatnet 1. Testamentary money (Testamentespeng) paid after death, 1639. On Älvsborgs Ransom list (lösen), 1613 (married).
