2 CONT Owns the ancestral farm Mjödvattnet 1 1631. Soldier (knekt) born abt. 1612 (25 years old in 1637) at Tjern, Mjödvattnet, Burträsk. Was on the discharge list in 1642 and 1648 (genvagar). Appears in Mantalslängd (tax rolls) 1654 to 
2 CONC 1686 (Kråken).
2 CONT
