1 NAME Jonas /Nilsson/
2 GIVN Jonas
2 SURN Nilsson
2 _MARNM Nicolai Buscherus
2 NICK Jonas Nilsson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1610
2 ADDR
3 CITY Byske
3 STAE Västerbottens län
3 POST 930 47
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1657
2 ADDR
3 CITY Umeå
3 STAE Västerbottens län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Stadspredikant i Umeå
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} First commissioner in Umeå Stad (City). From Bygdén: "COMMINISTERS IN UMEÅ CITY.
2 CONT 1. Jonas Nicolai Buscherus (1649-57), born in Byske in the 16th century. Pastorate of Skellefteå. Inskrefs ss. student in Upsala Nov. 1634. At the beginning of the year 1642 he received the archbishop's confirmation to become a pæ
2 CONC dagogus in schola Umensi in place of dn. Jonæ Laurenti and at the request of the pastor and the congregation. Became the city's first comminist in 1649 and in 1653 left a pedigree contribution to Sättna church. Died in 1657 (not 1
2 CONC 656) (UB N.n. 281).
2 CONT
2 CONT "Married Margareta Andersdotter Grubb, who after her husband's death lived in a 41-year-old widowhood and received widow's bread from Vibyggerå church hostel and contributions from the churchwardens in Umeå and Bygdeå; d. 1698.
2 CONT Son: Nicolaus Buscherus, b. 27/11 1645, dean and parish priest in Skellefteå, n. 14."
2 CONT
2 CONT From Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (1997):
2 CONT "Byske no. 4. . . . A third brother is Jon Nilsson who is the owner of a couple of farms in 1640-41. He is probably identical with Jonas Nicolai Büscherus who is a student in Uppsala in 1634. In 1642 he is a teacher in Umeå school
2 CONC . Then Büschems is the mayor of Umeå city 1649-57. Buschems who was from Byske died in 1657."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Bygdén, Leonard, "Hernösands Stifts Herdaminne. Bidrag till kännedomen om prästerskap och kyrkliga förhållanden till tiden omkring Luleå stifts utbrytning" (1926), "Umeå Stad"  "Jonas Nicolai Buscherus," p. 4.253, https://runeberg
2 CONC .org/hernosandh/4/0255.html
2 CONT Mentioned in son's biography, Bygdén, Leonard, "Hernösands Stifts Herdaminne" (1923-1926), "Skellefteå," "Mag. Nicolaus Jonæ Buscherus," p. 3.306, https://runeberg.org/hernosandh/3/0308.html
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (1997), https://umu.diva-portal.org/smash/get/diva2:729213/FULLTEXT02.pdf
2 CONT https://familjenbostrom.se/genealogi/bure/olof/11-44414.htm
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 301993 has dombok entries.
2 CONT From Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (1997).
2 CONT
