2 CONT Jon Persson (Petrus Olai Gestricius2, Olov Mårtensson1) was born 1597 in Njurunda,Y, and died 1639 in Baggböle, Umeå lfs,AC. He married Elisabet Sjulsdotter. She was born Okän, and died 1641 in Baggböle, Umeå lfs,AC.
