2 CONT Dordi Svensdotter married Olof Nilsson. Dordi's sister Margareta previously married her future husband, but Margareta died and Dordi became Olof's second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kyrkoräkenskaper (Church accounts) 1702 (from Kråken): Olof Olofsson in Tjärn gave 3 Karoliner after his blessed mother Dordi Svensdotter [who died].
