2 CONT
2 CONT Please note a question raised in "Discussions" : 
2 CONT Mar 12, 2025 at 11:30 AM by Annie N
2 CONT
2 CONT I vilken källa har ni hittat Brita Ersson (Hielmer ) (Bothniensis där det framgår tydligt att hon var dotter till Nicolaus Jacobi Bothniensis ?
2 CONT
2 CONT It would seem that Catharina Lithman, born ca. 1610, would have equal claim to be the daughter of Nicolaus Jacobi Bothniensis and Anna Börjesdotter, yet Catharine is not accepted as a daughter since no patronymic "Nicolasdotter" i
2 CONC s recorded for her. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the source cited above, neither is the patronymic "Nicolasdotter" recorded for Brita Lithman.
