1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Master goldsmith (guldsmedsmästaren) in Vaasa,  Österbotten (present day Finland), 1701. He lived in Jakobstad, Österbotten, 1678-1696, then Vaasa, 1700-1706. He married about 1678, according to the tax rolls (Mant
2 CONC alslängder), and died about 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person
2 CONT Family Boströms, https://familjenbostrom.se/genealogi/bure/olof/11-44414.htm
2 CONT Discussions about Diurman family in Umeå in Anbytarforum, https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=38621.msg589562 and https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=38621.msg589563
