1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mattias Diurman can be found in Umeå stad in the 1708-1714 census. Then the family moved to Skellefteå. He was vice länsman (Deputy County Sheriff) from 1715 to 1716 in Prästbordet, Skellefteå lfs. Died around 1716
2 CONC  in Prästbordet, Skellefteå lfs, because his widow is found on the 1717 and 1720 tax lists (mantalslängd).
2 CONT
2 CONT Court Judgment Book (Dombok) entries (from Geni):
2 CONT Dombok 1708 Umeå stad: Mathias Diurman was appointed rote master in the 4th roten in Umeå city.
2 CONT Dombok 1709 Umeå stad: "Citizens (Borgarna) Mathias Diurman, Olof Olofsson, Forsberg, Anders Abrahamsson Bohman their late father-in-law Pär Andersson Flarck."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Skellefteå socken 1650-1790," pp. 761, 488.
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 185571 gives "SB" as birth source, b. ca. 1670.
2 CONT ---------
